				\begin{document}$$ Latent\;utility = \beta_{1} MO_{2} + \beta_{2} MO_{3} + \beta_{3} MO_{4} + \beta_{4} MO_{5} + \beta_{5} SC_{2} + \ldots + \beta_{20} AD_{5} + \beta_{21} MO_{2} *study\;dummy + \beta_{22} MO_{3} *study \, dummy + \beta_{23} MO_{4} *study\;dummy \ldots + \beta_{40} AD_{5} *study \, dummy + \varepsilon $$\end{document}Latentutility=β1MO2+β2MO3+β3MO4+β4MO5+β5SC2+…+β20AD5+β21MO2∗studydummy+β22MO3∗studydummy+β23MO4∗studydummy…+β40AD5∗studydummy+ε
